curl_cffi 0.16.0 links libcurl-impersonate statically into its extension
module. curl-impersonate 2.0.0 built that library from the sources listed
after it. The license files of curl-impersonate and of each library are in
the directory of the same name. libidn2, which includes its own copy of
libunistring, is licensed under GPL-2.0-or-later or LGPL-3.0-or-later. The
libidn2 archive is its source. The curl_cffi source release and the
curl-impersonate archive, which has the patches and build scripts, are what
you need to rebuild the extension module with a modified libidn2.

